---
import OpenKubesWordmark from './OpenKubesWordmark.astro';
interface Props { lang:'de'|'en' }
const {lang}=Astro.props;
const d={"de":{"eyebrow":"OPENKUBES · PLATFORM DISTRIBUTION FRAMEWORK","title":"Ihre Kubernetes-Plattform.","accent":"Ihre Regeln.","lead":"OpenKubes ist ein offenes Framework für souveräne Kubernetes-Plattformen. Es trennt Plattformanforderungen von konkreten Komponenten – mit nachvollziehbaren Verträgen, deklarativem Betrieb und überprüfbaren Ergebnissen.","primary":"Architektur kennenlernen","secondary":"Mit Engineers sprechen","pill":"CONTRACTS FIRST · EVIDENCE DRIVEN · HUMAN CONTROLLED","principles":[["01","Contracts First","Plattformfähigkeiten werden durch stabile Anforderungen statt durch einzelne Produkte definiert."],["02","Evidence Driven","Eine Bereitstellung gilt erst als erfolgreich, wenn die vereinbarten Kriterien nachweisbar erfüllt sind."],["03","Sovereign by Design","Infrastruktur, Komponenten und Anbieter bleiben im Rahmen klarer Verträge austauschbar."]],"sTitle":"Souveränität ist eine Eigenschaft der Architektur.","sText":"Kubernetes standardisiert Anwendungen – doch die Plattform selbst kann trotzdem von einem Anbieter oder bestimmten Implementierungen abhängen. OpenKubes setzt auf explizite Capability Contracts, versionierte Konfigurationen und kontrollierte Entscheidungen, damit die eigene Plattform langfristig gestaltbar bleibt.","sLink":"Sovereign Platform Engineering entdecken","aTitle":"Ein Betriebsmodell. Viele Umgebungen.","aText":"Vom Entwickler-Laptop über Bare Metal und industrielle Edge-Standorte bis zu Cloud-Umgebungen: OpenKubes Anywhere verfolgt konsistente GitOps- und Cluster-Lifecycle-Prozesse, ohne identische Infrastruktur vorauszusetzen.","aLink":"OpenKubes Anywhere entdecken","cap":"TECHNOLOGIE & LÖSUNGEN","capTitle":"Offene Grundlagen. Konkrete Einsatzfelder.","cards":[["Inhouse AI","Private LLMs, RAG, GPU und MLOps auf eigener Kubernetes-Infrastruktur.","inhouse-ai/"],["Bare Metal","Kubernetes, KubeVirt und deklarativer Infrastruktur-Lifecycle.","../products/bare-metal/"],["Industrial Edge","Verteilte Cluster, lokale KI und GitOps-Operations über viele Standorte.","openkubes-edge/index.html"],["Robotics & Physical AI","ROS 2, Open-RMF, Edge AI und industrielle Flottenintegration.","../products/robotics/"],["Security & Governance","Identity, Policies, Supply Chain und überprüfbare Sicherheitsvorgaben.","../products/security/"]],"note":"OpenKubes ist ein Framework mit austauschbaren Implementierungsprofilen. Der konkrete Funktions- und Reifegrad wird je Profil und Projekt validiert.","external":"Offizielles OpenKubes-Projekt","footerTitle":"Souveräne Plattformen gemeinsam entwickeln.","footerText":"Wir helfen Ihnen, Plattformanforderungen zu definieren, passende Implementierungsprofile zu wählen und die Betriebsbereitschaft anhand nachvollziehbarer Kriterien zu bewerten.","footerCta":"Plattformstrategie besprechen"},"en":{"eyebrow":"OPENKUBES · PLATFORM DISTRIBUTION FRAMEWORK","title":"Your Kubernetes platform.","accent":"Your terms.","lead":"OpenKubes is an open framework for sovereign Kubernetes platforms. It separates platform requirements from specific components through explicit contracts, declarative operations and verifiable outcomes.","primary":"Explore the architecture","secondary":"Talk to our engineers","pill":"CONTRACTS FIRST · EVIDENCE DRIVEN · HUMAN CONTROLLED","principles":[["01","Contracts First","Capabilities are defined by stable requirements instead of individual products."],["02","Evidence Driven","Provisioning is complete only when agreed acceptance criteria can be verified."],["03","Sovereign by Design","Infrastructure, tools and providers can be replaced within clear capability boundaries."]],"sTitle":"Sovereignty starts in the architecture.","sText":"Kubernetes makes applications portable, but enterprise platforms can still depend heavily on vendors and implementation details. OpenKubes uses explicit capability contracts, versioned configuration and controlled change so teams retain meaningful architectural choices.","sLink":"Explore Sovereign Platform Engineering","aTitle":"One operating model. Many environments.","aText":"From developer laptops through bare metal and industrial edge sites to public cloud: OpenKubes Anywhere applies consistent GitOps and cluster lifecycle practices without assuming identical infrastructure.","aLink":"Explore OpenKubes Anywhere","cap":"TECHNOLOGY & SOLUTIONS","capTitle":"Open foundations. Real-world applications.","cards":[["Inhouse AI","Private LLMs, RAG, GPU infrastructure and MLOps on controlled Kubernetes.","inhouse-ai/"],["Bare Metal","Kubernetes, KubeVirt and declarative infrastructure lifecycle.","../products/bare-metal/"],["Industrial Edge","Distributed clusters, local inference and GitOps across sites.","openkubes-edge/index.html"],["Robotics & Physical AI","ROS 2, Open-RMF, edge AI and industrial fleet integration.","../products/robotics/"],["Security & Governance","Identity, policy, supply chains and reviewable security evidence.","../products/security/"]],"note":"OpenKubes is a framework with replaceable implementation profiles. Availability and maturity of specific capabilities depend on the profile and project.","external":"Official OpenKubes project","footerTitle":"Engineer sovereign platforms together.","footerText":"Define platform requirements, evaluate implementation profiles and verify operational readiness with our engineering team.","footerCta":"Discuss your platform strategy"}}[lang];
const root='/'+lang+'/openkubes/';
const contact='/'+lang+'/contact/';
---
<main class="ok-overview">
 <section class="ok-overview__hero"><div class="wrap ok-overview__hero-grid">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">{d.eyebrow}</p><h1>{d.title}<br/><em>{d.accent}</em></h1><p class="ok-overview__lead">{d.lead}</p>
   <div class="ok-overview__buttons"><a class="ok-overview__primary" href="#architecture">{d.primary} ↗</a><a class="ok-overview__secondary" href={contact}>{d.secondary} ↗</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ok-overview__diagram" aria-label="OpenKubes capability contracts">
   <div class="ok-overview__seal"><OpenKubesWordmark theme="dark"/></div>
   <div class="ok-overview__layers"><div>CAPABILITY CONTRACTS</div><div>IMPLEMENTATION PROFILES</div><div>KUBERNETES · INFRASTRUCTURE</div></div>
   <p>{d.pill}</p>
  </div>
 </div></section>
 <section id="architecture" class="ok-overview__principles"><div class="wrap">
   <p class="eyebrow">THE OPENKUBES PRINCIPLES</p>
   <div class="ok-overview__principle-grid">{d.principles.map(([number,title,desc])=><article><span>{number} / PRINCIPLE</span><h2>{title}</h2><p>{desc}</p></article>)}</div>
 </div></section>
 <section class="ok-overview__paths"><div class="wrap">
  <div id="sovereign-platform" class="ok-overview__feature"><div><p class="eyebrow">SOVEREIGN PLATFORM ENGINEERING</p><h2>{d.sTitle}</h2><p>{d.sText}</p><a href={root+'sovereign-platform/'}>{d.sLink} ↗</a></div><div class="ok-overview__symbol ok-overview__symbol--sovereign"><span>CONTRACT</span><span>EVIDENCE</span><span>CONTROL</span></div></div>
  <div id="anywhere" class="ok-overview__feature ok-overview__feature--reverse"><div><p class="eyebrow">OPENKUBES ANYWHERE</p><h2>{d.aTitle}</h2><p>{d.aText}</p><a href={root+'openkubes-anywhere/'}>{d.aLink} ↗</a></div><div class="ok-overview__symbol"><span>LOCAL</span><span>BARE METAL</span><span>EDGE · CLOUD</span></div></div>
 </div></section>
 <section id="solutions" class="ok-overview__solutions"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">{d.cap}</p><h2>{d.capTitle}</h2>
  <div class="ok-overview__solution-grid">{d.cards.map(([title,description,url],i)=><a href={root+url} class="ok-overview__solution"><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / SOLUTION</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p><strong>{lang==='de'?'Mehr erfahren':'Explore'} ↗</strong></a>)}</div>
  <p class="ok-overview__note">{d.note}</p><a class="ok-overview__external" href="https://openkubes.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{d.external} ↗</a>
 </div></section>
 <section class="ok-overview__closing"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING · OPEN SOURCE · SOVEREIGNTY</p><h2>{d.footerTitle}</h2><p>{d.footerText}</p><a href={contact}>{d.footerCta} ↗</a></div></section>
</main>